<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Allied Holdings cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Allied Holdings cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it lowered its recommendation on Allied Holdings Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 5/16 to 8-7/16 in in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
